{"synopsis":"“Yan,” sang protagonis, dicuci otak oleh kaisar dan hidup sebagai bonekanya. Setelah mengetahui dia dipermainkan oleh kaisar, dia berencana untuk membalas dendam, namun pingsan karena kekuatan kaisar. Dia pikir dia telah mati, tetapi ketika dia bangun, dia menyadari bahwa dia telah mengalami kemunduran ke saat dia masih menjadi anggota baru. Entah untuk membalas dendam pada kaisar atau mencari keluarganya. Pilihan ada di tangannya.","alternative_title":"사냥개의 회귀본능, Bloodhound's Regression Instinct","author":"Arco (아크로)","artist":"Studio W (스튜디오 W)","chapters":[{"number":"100","chapter":"100","slug":"845f0cae-2e2a-4030-a694-a941966c2cfd","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"number":"99","chapter":"99","slug":"e5818d48-c72f-4d0a-bf7d-adea28288204","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"number":"98","chapter":"98","slug":"de612748-1ded-4308-8cc4-8de91f9d4a54","date":"2026-01-01","images":[]},{"number":"97","chapter":"97","slug":"857d055d-2811-4de9-bfe2-0923d9d4e1f6","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"number":"96","chapter":"96","slug":"a783ec89-cfb8-42ad-881a-b43a4d85c2fc","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"number":"95","chapter":"95","slug":"38662015-c5ca-4e54-a426-62119fe894d2","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"number":"94","chapter":"94","slug":"f9d6186b-8a6f-4b22-bbec-752462240707","date":"2025-12-13","images":[]},{"number":"93","chapter":"93","slug":"63f96f9b-ffce-45ca-aaae-f227cad3e075","date":"2025-12-13","images":[]},{"number":"92","chapter":"92","slug":"d6fd68d7-168d-496d-b138-e9fc80df156d","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"number":"91","chapter":"91","slug":"ae6bc0c8-a4f8-4b36-90b8-fb1becfb5a15","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"number":"90","chapter":"90","slug":"fe9a9681-7efe-4d01-9321-038d78e79e50","date":"2025-11-11","images":[]},{"number":"89","chapter":"89","slug":"4d5bd2f4-8774-47c0-886e-58a400d9fb33","date":"2025-10-24","images":[]},{"number":"88","chapter":"88","slug":"1eaddb37-ab6c-4cf2-95ff-9478f82362fa","date":"2025-10-17","images":[]},{"